NFR = 'Provider-neutral core; bounded deterministic inputs/outputs; cancellation/idempotency; project isolation; versioned compatibility; no UI/storage bypass.'

def card(t):
    (num, cat, milestone, title, objective, why, scope, non_scope, files, deps, req, tests, security, observability, docs, rollback, unlock) = t
    acceptance = req
    return f'''### PR-{num} — {title}\n\n- **ID:** PR-{num}\n- **Categoria:** {cat}\n- **Milestone:** {milestone}\n- **Título:** {title}\n- **Objetivo:** {objective}\n- **Problema resolvido:** {why}\n- **Escopo:** {scope}\n- **Não-escopo:** {non_scope}\n- **Arquivos/crates prováveis:** {files}\n- **Contratos afetados:** Harness common envelopes/ADRs/ports indicados no escopo; contratos existentes só por compatibilidade explícita.\n- **Dependências anteriores:** {deps}\n- **Requisitos funcionais:** {req}\n- **NFRs:** {NFR}\n- **Critérios de aceite verificáveis:** {acceptance}\n- **Testes unitários:** {tests}\n- **Testes de integração:** Integração da boundary real quando este card introduzir adapter/store; caso contrário, fixture de contrato executada por adapter fake.\n- **Testes de contrato:** Schema/version/unknown-field and compatibility tests for every affected envelope/port.\n- **Testes negativos:** Identity, scope, stale, duplicate, budget, malformed and unauthorized cases relevant to this card; no happy-path-only closure.\n- **E2E obrigatório quando aplicável:** E2E declarado em cards TESTING; cards de base só desbloqueiam o E2E dependente.\n- **Performance quando aplicável:** Measure bounded latency/size for context, retrieval, checkpoint, routing, replay or concurrency paths; regressions require baseline evidence.\n- **Verificações de segurança:** {security}\n- **Observabilidade:** {observability}\n- **Evidência:** Exact SHA/tree/policy/schema revisions, commands, test artifacts and redacted digests; PASS/FAIL/BLOCKED/NO_PROOF only.\n- **Documentação:** {docs}\n- **Rollback:** {rollback}\n- **Definition of Done:** Scope-only implementation, acceptance/tests/security/observability/docs/rollback evidence on exact SHA, independent review, applicable full regression gates, no stale or missing proof.\n- **Condição para desbloquear a próxima PR:** {unlock}\n\n'''

out = '# Executable Post-270 Harness Queue — PR-271..PR-345\n\n**Status:** PLANNED. This extension is separate from and does not modify PR-001..PR-270. Implementation is blocked until PR-270 entry gate passes.\n\n## Card contract\n\nEvery card below is small, isolated, reversible and evidence-bound. Unit, contract, integration, negative, E2E/performance/security requirements are explicit in each card; required full regression gates remain additive.\n\n'
out += ''.join(card(c) for c in CARDS)
Path('.planning/queue/queue-271-345.md').write_text(out)
print(f'wrote {len(CARDS)} cards: PR-{CARDS[0][0]}..PR-{CARDS[-1][0]}')
